+``subtitle-layout-revision``
+    Monotonic revision of the latest structured subtitle-layout state. It
+    changes when a new immutable snapshot replaces the current one or when the
+    current snapshot becomes unavailable. Repeated equivalent renders retain
+    the original snapshot and its acquisition timestamps. The property is
+    observable, but updates may be coalesced; fetch ``subtitle-layout`` to
+    obtain the latest state. See ``--subtitle-layout``.
+
